/target

# Generated exports — never commit private conversation data.
*.pdf
*.html
# …but the desktop app.s Vite entry point is source, not an export. This also
# decides what Tailwind can see: its automatic source detection skips gitignored
# files, so an un-excepted index.html silently produces no utilities for the
# classes written in it. (The marketing site needs no exception: Astro has no
# index.html source file, it emits them.)
!apps/desktop/index.html

# Generated fixture databases — schema.sql + seed.sql are the source of truth.
*.db
# Runtime-written fixture attachment copies (source image: crates/msg2pdf-fixture/lunch.jpeg).
*-attachments/

# Frontend build output (desktop app and marketing site)
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/

# Local Claude Code config
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# Terraform working dirs and state (the .lock.hcl IS tracked: it pins providers)
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
